OL,3,GNEWSAProfessor shares 'most important
OL,4,Athing to do' when someone is grieving
OL,5,
OL,6,FKnowing what to say or how to support
OL,7,Fsomeone after a bereavement can be
OL,8,Fdifficult. Fear of saying the wrong
OL,9,Fthing or intruding at a sensitive time
OL,10,Fcan leave people worried about getting
OL,11,Fit wrong and avoiding reaching out
OL,12,Faltogether.
OL,14,FBut Dr Lesel Dawson, from the
OL,15,FUniversity of Bristol, said this is the
OL,16,Fworst thing people can do.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34102
SC,0002
