OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1792050943
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAProfessor shares 'most important
OL,4,Athing to do' when someone is grieving
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking ahead of an annual Good Grief
OL,7,FFestival that Dawson is co-director of,
OL,8,Fshe said: "The most important thing
OL,9,Fwhen helping someone dealing with grief
OL,10,Fisn't what you say, but that you don't
OL,11,Fturn away.
OL,13,F"A simply acknowledgement like, 'I'm so
OL,14,Fsorry and I'm here' can mean a great
OL,15,Fdeal and it's vital to let the grieving
OL,16,Fperson lead- to follow their pace,
OL,17,Ftheir language and their need to talk
OL,18,Fabout the person who died."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
